  {[0,1].map(set => (
    <ul key={set} aria-hidden={set===1} className="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-x-8 pr-8">
      ...
    </ul>
  ))}
</div>
```

Each ul has pr-8 to create spacing, equal widths. -50% is exact. Good.

