 *  Next's cookie serializer drops the `Partitioned` (CHIPS) attribute, which
 *  Chrome requires to store a third-party cookie inside the preview iframe
 *  — so the Set-Cookie header is built by hand here.
 *  https: SameSite=None; Secure; Partitioned (iframe-compatible).
 *  http:  SameSite=Lax (plain local dev). */
