 *   brand tier (premium vs commodity resale demand)
 *   age (posted recency where the vertical depreciates with age)
 *
 * The product-specific layer is what makes a phone with 78% battery health
 * price differently from the same phone at 96%, a DS sneaker differently from
 * a worn pair, and a bare tool differently from a kit with two batteries.
 *
